{c: Verse 1}
[D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa,        [A]Dil ke [D]siwaa
[D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa,        [A]Dil ke [D]siwaa
[D]Hai yahi dil koochaa [A]teraa,        Ae mere [G]hamdam [A]mere dost
[D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa,        [A]Dil ke [D]siwaa
[D]besabab [A]udegi [D]harsu,        [D]tere pair [A]han ki [D]khushbu
[G]idhar to [A]aa [D]sawar [A]du,        [G]khule [A]khule ye [D]ge [A]su
[G]wafa [A]de [D]ti [A]hai sa [G]da,        [D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa
[A]Dil ke [D]siwaa,        [D]aake khun-e- [A]dil [D]milake,
[D]bhar du in [A]labo ke [D]khake,        [G]bujha [A]bhujha [D]badan [A]tera
[G]kamal [A]kamal [D]bana [A]ke,        [G]khila [A]du [D]rang- [A]e-hi [G]na
[D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa,        [A]Dil ke [D]siwaa
[D]aaj sahar-e- [A]dil me [D]chalkar,        [D]surat-e- [A]chirag [D]jalkar
[G]kisi [A]jhuki [D]hui [A]nazar,        [G]ke kaa [A]jal se [D]dil [A]par
[G]likhe [A]aaa [D]naam- [A]e-wa [G]fa,        [D]Na jaa Kahin ab na [G]jaa
[A]Dil ke [D]siwaa,        [D]Hai yahi dil koochaa [A]teraa
